OL,3,ACounter-terror police lead
OL,4,Ainvestigation into major incident near
OL,5,ARAF base, officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities are about to give an update
OL,8,Fon a major incident near RAF Fairford -
OL,9,Fwatch live footage from the scene above
OL,11,FCounter-terror police are leading the
OL,12,Finvestigation after several men were
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion of offences under
OL,14,Fthe Explosives Act
OL,16,FResidents in the village of Whelford,
OL,17,Fnear the base, have been evacuated -
OL,18,Fwhat we know so far
OL,20,F"It all happened very quickly. We just
OL,21,Fpacked our stuff up and came here,"
OL,22,Fsays one of the evacuated residents
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
